// Expanded Psionics Handbook — POWERS (Chapter 5), transcribed from
// Shaun's own copy, 2026-11-05.
//
// Powers are modeled as SpellDefinition records, the same way the
// Magic of Incarnum soulmelds are: the "school" is the power's
// discipline with a "(psionic power)" tag, the printed subschool
// (Creation, Scrying, Teleportation, Healing, ...) rides in the
// subschool field, and printed descriptors ride in descriptors[].
// There is no Display field on SpellDefinition, so the power's
// Display line rides in components (precedent: the soulmeld pack
// puts its nonstandard stat material there too). Manifesting
// Time rides in castingTime; Power Resistance rides in
// spellResistance. Power Points and the power's Augment text ride
// in the summary and in the full description.
//
// Level keys use the book's own list names: "Psion/Wilder",
// "Psychic Warrior", and the six discipline lists (Seer, Shaper,
// Kineticist, Egoist, Nomad, Telepath). No psionic casting
// profiles exist in casting-profiles.ts yet, so these keys are
// the book's spellings, ready to be matched when profiles land.
//
// Variant powers whose printed stat block is abbreviated in the
// book ("As cloud mind, except as noted here") inherit the stat
// lines the book does not reprint from the base power named in
// their note. A handful of powers print no Display line at all
// (Etherealness, Psionic; Major Creation, Psionic; Psionic
// Revivify; True Creation) — those carry components
// "Display: None". Hustle, Missive, and Missive, Mass print no
// Duration line; their duration is recorded as Instantaneous.
// Shaun's campaign uses the psionics-magic transparency rule:
// powers and spells interact (spell resistance is power
// resistance, dispel magic works on powers and vice versa),
// exactly as the book's default assumes.
//
// Stat blocks were cross-checked against rendered pages wherever
// the OCR layer garbled a number or dropped a line; the spots
// verified by eye are listed in the build report
// (~/workspace/library-staging/expanded-psionics-powers-draft.md).
