    spellResistance: "No",
    summary: "You draw writhing strands of ectoplasm from the Astral Plane that wrap up the subject like a mummy. Power Points: 5. Augment: You can augment this power in one or both of the following ways. 1. For every 2 additional power points you spend, this power’s save DC increases by 1. 2. For every 2 additional power points you spend, this power can affect a target one size category larger.",
